This directory vendors DFlash's own model/generation code to run this
experiment's instrumented drafter:

* vendor/dflash/ -- from DFlash, MIT License.
  License copy: vendor/dflash/LICENSE
  Chen, Jian; Liang, Yesheng; Liu, Zhijian. "DFlash: Block Diffusion for
  Flash Speculative Decoding." arXiv preprint arXiv:2602.06036, 2026.

  MODIFIED from upstream: model.py's dflash_generate() gained an optional
  `return_topk_recall` argument that additionally records, per draft round,
  the rank of the verifier's per-position token within the drafter's own
  logit ordering at every block position. No other behavior changes; with
  return_topk_recall left at its default (False), generation is identical
  to upstream.

data/mtbench_subset.jsonl is a small subset of MT-Bench prompts (prompt
text only, no third-party generations or annotations).
